# gladiator

--- Gladiator_gadget | gadget | TID_GLADIATOR_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Damian throws his microphone to a target location. The first teammate to pick it up is healed for <!card.accessory.skill.spawneditem.statuseffectally.healing.scaletolevel> health.
now  Damian throws his microphone to a target location. The first teammate to pick it up is healed for <!card.accessory.skill.spawneditem.statuseffectally.healing.scaletolevel> health.
  card.accessory.skill.spawneditem.statuseffectally.healing.scaletolevel  -  -> 3200

--- Gladiator_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_GLADIATOR_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Damian's Super also sets the ground on fire when he lands, dealing <!card.character.component.areaeffect[1].damage.scaletolevel> damage per sec to enemies caught in his mosh pit!
now  Damian's Super also sets the ground on fire when he lands, dealing 1200 damage per sec to enemies caught in his mosh pit!
  card.character.component.areaeffect[1].damage.scaletolevel  1200  -> 1200

--- Gladiator_unique | star power | TID_GLADIATOR_SP_1_DESC
raw  Knocking a target into a wall stuns them for <!card.value1.ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Knocking a target into a wall stuns them for 0.5 sec.
  card.value1.ticksasseconds  0.5  -> 0.5

--- Gladiator_ulti | super | TID_GLADIATOR_ULTI_DESC
raw  Damian leaps and creates a personal Mosh Pit lasting <!card.character.ultiskill.areaeffectobject2.timems.msasseconds> seconds. Inside the pit, enemies are knocked back when hitting speakers, dealing <!card.character.component[0].value[2]> Damage.
now  Damian leaps and creates a personal Mosh Pit lasting <!card.character.ultiskill.areaeffectobject2.timems.msasseconds> seconds. Inside the pit, enemies are knocked back when hitting speakers, dealing 1000 Damage.
  card.character.ultiskill.areaeffectobject2.timems.msasseconds  -  -> 5
  card.character.component[0].value[2]  1000  -> 1000
